  triage:title "No success-path integration test for the cache-disabled dispatch else-arm" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health/peer_delivery_router.rs:49-63 (the AK.9-migrated else-arm) has no test that disables peer_resend_cache, drives a successful peer response, and asserts one messages[] request + atomic marker removal + no local nudge. resend_cache.rs only covers the disabled-cache failure path; the only success-path dispatch test (runtime_root.rs:224-299) exercises the scheduler if branch, not the migrated else branch. Sprint doc's required-validation list mandates a focused dispatch integration test for exactly this else-arm success path." ;
